# Trial of Dominion with a test bot. Three cows moved into the pen: passed=true.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotDom
@sleep 2
kill TtlBotDom
execute as TtlBotDom run ttl wish dominion
execute as TtlBotDom run ttl trial
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotDom
execute in ttl:spirit_corridor run tp @e[tag=ttl_herd,limit=3] 1811.5 65 11.5
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotDom
ttl reset TtlBotDom
ttlbot remove TtlBotDom
